    1.1,                     !- Source Energy Factor {J/J}  Source: xlsx C72 = 1.1.
    ,                        !- Source Energy Schedule Name
    55.5556;                 !- CO2 Emission Factor {g/MJ}  Derived from xlsx D72: 200 g/kWh / 3.6 = 55.5556 g/MJ.
! Source for FuelFactors "FuelOilNo1": xlsx Sheet1 row 73 "Fuel": primary energy factor 1.2, CO2 250 g/kWh.
FuelFactors,
    FuelOilNo1,              !- Existing Fuel Resource Name  Derived from xlsx B73 'Fuel' (the only liquid fuel of EnergyPlus's fuel list that the xlsx 'Fuel' can map to; modelling choice).
    1.2,                     !- Source Energy Factor {J/J}  Source: xlsx C73 = 1.2.
    ,                        !- Source Energy Schedule Name
    69.4444;                 !- CO2 Emission Factor {g/MJ}  Derived from xlsx D73: 250 g/kWh / 3.6 = 69.4444 g/MJ.
! Source for UtilityCost:Tariff "Electricity Flat" and its charge: xlsx Sheet1 J73 Electricity Price = 0.12 $ per kWh. The other cost items (J66..J72, J69..J71) are 0 or not modelled.
UtilityCost:Tariff,
    Electricity Flat,        !- Name
    Electricity:Facility,    !- Output Meter Name  Derived from xlsx J73 (electricity price); Kept: modelling choice (whole-building electricity).
    kWh;                     !- Conversion Factor Choice
UtilityCost:Charge:Simple,
    FlatEnergyCharge,        !- Name
    Electricity Flat,        !- Tariff Name
    totalEnergy,             !- Source Variable
    Annual,                  !- Season
    EnergyCharges,           !- Category Variable Name
    0.12;                    !- Cost per Unit {USD/kWh}  Source: xlsx J73 = 0.12 per kWh.

